{"title": "Magic Melee Weapon Trader Table", "pageid": 16258, "url": "https://bg3.wiki/wiki/Magic_Melee_Weapon_Trader_Table", "categories": ["Drop tables", "Vendor tables"], "html": "<div class=\"mw-content-ltr mw-parser-output\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\"><p><b>Magic Melee Weapon Trader Table</b>, also known as <code>EquipmentTrader_Melee_Magic</code>&nbsp;<span class=\"mw-default-size bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"https://bg3.norbyte.dev/search?q=name:EquipmentTrader_Melee_Magic+type:treasuretable\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noreferrer noopener\"><img alt=\"https://bg3.norbyte.dev/search?q=name:EquipmentTrader_Melee_Magic+type:treasuretable\" src=\"/w/images/7/70/Search_icon.svg\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"14\" height=\"14\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></a></span> is a non-leveled <a href=\"/wiki/Treasure_Table\" title=\"Treasure Table\">Treasure Table</a> that contains magic <a href=\"/wiki/Category:Melee_weapons\" title=\"Category:Melee weapons\">melee weapons</a>.\n</p>\n\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Drop_table\">Drop table</span></h2>\n<p><i>The following section can be transcluded into other pages with <code>{{:Magic Melee Weapon Trader Table}}</code>.</i>\n</p>\n<table class=\"wikitable sortable\">\n\n<tbody><tr>\n  <th colspan=\"2\">Item</th>\n  <th>Quantity</th>\n  <th>Chance</th>\n</tr>\n\n<tr>\n\n\n<th style=\"text-align: left; padding: 0.4rem\" colspan=\"2\">\n<span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-block\" style=\"gap: 6px\"><span class=\"nowrap bg3wiki-icontext-icon\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-itemicon bg3wiki-itemicon-uncommon\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Simple_Melee_Weapon_Subtable_%2B1\" title=\"Simple Melee Weapon Subtable +1\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/d/de/Simple_Weapon_Prof_Icon.png/40px-Simple_Weapon_Prof_Icon.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/d/de/Simple_Weapon_Prof_Icon.png/60px-Simple_Weapon_Prof_Icon.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/d/de/Simple_Weapon_Prof_Icon.png 2x\"><img alt=\"\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/d/de/Simple_Weapon_Prof_Icon.png/40px-Simple_Weapon_Prof_Icon.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"40\" height=\"40\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/d/de/Simple_Weapon_Prof_Icon.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span></span><a href=\"/wiki/Simple_Melee_Weapon_Subtable_%2B1\" title=\"Simple Melee Weapon Subtable +1\">Simple Melee Weapon Subtable +1</a></span> </th>\n<td style=\"text-align:center\">2</td>\n<td style=\"text-align:center\">Always</td></tr>\n<tr>\n\n\n<th style=\"text-align: left; padding: 0.4rem\" colspan=\"2\">\n<span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-block\" style=\"gap: 6px\"><span class=\"nowrap bg3wiki-icontext-icon\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-itemicon bg3wiki-itemicon-uncommon\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Martial_Melee_Weapon_Subtable_%2B1\" title=\"Martial Melee Weapon Subtable +1\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/1/17/Martial_Weapon_Prof_Icon.png/40px-Martial_Weapon_Prof_Icon.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/1/17/Martial_Weapon_Prof_Icon.png/60px-Martial_Weapon_Prof_Icon.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/1/17/Martial_Weapon_Prof_Icon.png 2x\"><img alt=\"\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/1/17/Martial_Weapon_Prof_Icon.png/40px-Martial_Weapon_Prof_Icon.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"40\" height=\"40\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/1/17/Martial_Weapon_Prof_Icon.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span></span><a href=\"/wiki/Martial_Melee_Weapon_Subtable_%2B1\" title=\"Martial Melee Weapon Subtable +1\">Martial Melee Weapon Subtable +1</a></span> </th>\n<td style=\"text-align:center\">2</td>\n<td style=\"text-align:center\">Always</td></tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Traders\">Traders</span></h2>\n<h3><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Act_1\">Act 1</span></h3>\n<ul><li><a href=\"/wiki/Dammon\" title=\"Dammon\">Dammon</a> in the <a href=\"/wiki/Emerald_Grove\" title=\"Emerald Grove\">Emerald Grove</a>.</li>\n<li><a href=\"/wiki/Brem\" title=\"Brem\">Brem</a> in the <a href=\"/wiki/Zhentarim_Hideout\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Zhentarim Hideout\">Zhentarim Hideout</a>.</li>\n<li><a href=\"/wiki/Roah_Moonglow\" title=\"Roah Moonglow\">Roah Moonglow</a> in the <a href=\"/wiki/Shattered_Sanctum\" title=\"Shattered Sanctum\">Shattered Sanctum</a>.</li>\n<li><a href=\"/wiki/A%27jak%27nir_Jeera\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"A'jak'nir Jeera\">A'jak'nir Jeera</a> in <a href=\"/wiki/Cr%C3%A8che_Y%27llek\" title=\"Crèche Y'llek\">Crèche Y'llek</a>.</li></ul>\n<h3><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Act_2\">Act 2</span></h3>\n<ul><li><a href=\"/wiki/Dammon\" title=\"Dammon\">Dammon</a> at the forge outside the <a href=\"/wiki/Last_Light_Inn\" title=\"Last Light Inn\">Last Light Inn</a>.</li>\n<li><a href=\"/wiki/Roah_Moonglow\" title=\"Roah Moonglow\">Roah Moonglow</a> in <a href=\"/wiki/Moonrise_Towers\" title=\"Moonrise Towers\">Moonrise Towers</a>.</li>\n<li><a href=\"/wiki/Talli\" title=\"Talli\">Talli</a> at the <a href=\"/wiki/Last_Light_Inn\" title=\"Last Light Inn\">Last Light Inn</a>.</li>\n<li><a href=\"/wiki/Lann_Tarv\" title=\"Lann Tarv\">Lann Tarv</a> in <a href=\"/wiki/Moonrise_Towers\" title=\"Moonrise Towers\">Moonrise Towers</a>.</li></ul>\n<h3><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Act_3\">Act 3</span></h3>\n<ul><li><a href=\"/wiki/Dammon\" title=\"Dammon\">Dammon</a> at the <a href=\"/wiki/Forge_of_the_Nine\" title=\"Forge of the Nine\">Forge of the Nine</a>.</li>\n<li><a href=\"/wiki/Fytz\" title=\"Fytz\">Fytz</a> at the <a href=\"/wiki/Stormshore_Armoury\" title=\"Stormshore Armoury\">Stormshore Armoury</a> in the <a href=\"/wiki/Lower_City\" title=\"Lower City\">Lower City</a>.</li>\n<li><a href=\"/wiki/Exxvikyap\" title=\"Exxvikyap\">Exxvikyap</a> at the <a href=\"/wiki/Rivington_General\" title=\"Rivington General\">Rivington General</a> in <a href=\"/wiki/Rivington\" title=\"Rivington\">Rivington</a>.</li>\n<li><a href=\"/wiki/Entharl_Danthelon\" title=\"Entharl Danthelon\">Entharl Danthelon</a> at <a href=\"/wiki/Danthelon%27s_Dancing_Axe\" title=\"Danthelon's Dancing Axe\">Danthelon's Dancing Axe</a> in <a href=\"/wiki/Wyrm%27s_Crossing\" title=\"Wyrm's Crossing\">Wyrm's Crossing</a>.</li>\n<li><a href=\"/wiki/Arkleia_Oloril\" title=\"Arkleia Oloril\">Arkleia Oloril</a> in <a href=\"/wiki/Wyrm%27s_Rock_Fortress\" title=\"Wyrm's Rock Fortress\">Wyrm's Rock Fortress</a>.</li></ul>\n\n<!-- \nNewPP limit report\nCached time: 20260714205123\nCache expiry: 86400\nReduced expiry: false\nComplications: [show‐toc]\nCPU time usage: 0.036 seconds\nReal time usage: 0.039 seconds\nPreprocessor visited node count: 999/1000000\nPost‐expand include size: 9691/4194304 bytes\nTemplate argument size: 2232/4194304 bytes\nHighest expansion depth: 21/200\nExpensive parser function count: 0/750\nUnstrip recursion depth: 0/20\nUnstrip post‐expand size: 4/5000000 bytes\nExtLoops count: 0/1000\nLua time usage: 0.017/7.000 seconds\nLua memory usage: 826324/52428800 bytes\n-->\n<!--\nTransclusion expansion time report (%,ms,calls,template)\n100.00%   30.559      1 -total\n 59.62%   18.218      2 Template:DropTableRow\n 52.85%   16.151      2 Template:LgRarityItem\n 43.18%   13.195      2 Template:Item_icon\n 22.83%    6.976      1 Template:ItemIcon_Insert\n 11.87%    3.629      4 Template:ItemIcon_Internal\n 11.12%    3.398      1 Template:Norbyte\n 10.42%    3.183      4 Template:Ifempty\n  7.82%    2.391     15 Template:Trim\n  6.12%    1.870      4 Template:Icon\n-->\n\n<!-- Saved in parser cache with key bg3wiki:pcache:idhash:16258-0!canonical and timestamp 20260714205123 and revision id 396576. Rendering was triggered because: unknown\n -->\n</div>"}